The Mercedes-Benz Vito SELECT is a trim level available on the current W447 generation Vito, which received a significant facelift in 2024. It is positioned above the base "PRO" trim and below the top "Premium" or "Sport" trims (depending on market and model year). The SELECT trim is often associated with the Tourer (passenger) or higher-spec Crew Van variants, offering enhanced features compared to the more basic commercial versions.

